What this does not do
---------------------

It grants you nothing with respect to Adobe's code. Obtaining the InDesign SDK,
and complying with whatever agreement Adobe attaches to it, remains entirely
between you and Adobe. This exception only removes the GPL's objection to the
combination; it does not create a right to the other half of it.

It also does not weaken the GPL over StrokeMaster itself. The source in this
repository, the ExtendScript in tools/jsx/ (which links nothing and never
needed the exception in the first place), and any modification you make to
either, stay GPL-3.0-or-later.
